{
  "id": "1Ec3rMMLyWg",
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 8.51,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "And a toasty 75 degrees for daughter Haley.",
          "start": 0.08,
          "end": 3.96
        },
        {
          "text": "You see, the Verona boasts individualized climate zones, Claire.",
          "start": 4.92,
          "end": 8.51
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "toasty",
          "ko": "따뜻하고 아늑한",
          "type": "word"
        },
        {
          "term": "boasts",
          "ko": "(자랑할 만한 기능을) 갖추고 있다",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 8.51,
      "end": 13.84,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Mhm.",
          "start": 8.51,
          "end": 9.01
        },
        {
          "text": "I could literally transport a polar bear and an orchid and not make two trips.",
          "start": 9.01,
          "end": 13.84
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "orchid",
          "ko": "난초",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 14.84,
      "end": 17.52,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Dad, I'm freezing.",
          "start": 14.84,
          "end": 15.95
        },
        {
          "text": "It's like one degree back here.",
          "start": 15.95,
          "end": 17.52
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 18.8,
      "end": 23.68,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Six minutes in and it begins.",
          "start": 18.8,
          "end": 21.6
        },
        {
          "text": "Here, take the blanket from the bed.",
          "start": 22,
          "end": 23.68
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 24.04,
      "end": 27.04,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Thanks, kitten.",
          "start": 24.04,
          "end": 25
        },
        {
          "text": "Dad, can you change the music?",
          "start": 25.76,
          "end": 27.04
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 27.08,
      "end": 30.76,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Can I?",
          "start": 27.08,
          "end": 27.72
        },
        {
          "text": "Oh, no. Oh, no. That's just getting louder.",
          "start": 28.68,
          "end": 30.76
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 30.76,
      "end": 35.52,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "This isn't good. It's not good at all.",
          "start": 30.76,
          "end": 33
        },
        {
          "text": "- Actually, it's kind of perfect. - Right?",
          "start": 33.48,
          "end": 35.52
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 35.84,
      "end": 41.08,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The big windows, the classical music, it's like we're in a movie.",
          "start": 35.84,
          "end": 39.2
        },
        {
          "text": "Turn it up, handsome.",
          "start": 40,
          "end": 41.08
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 41.32,
      "end": 48.92,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You got it.",
          "start": 41.32,
          "end": 42.24
        },
        {
          "text": "Obviously, the novelty of the situation was delaying the inevitable.",
          "start": 45.76,
          "end": 48.92
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "novelty",
          "ko": "신기함, 새로움",
          "type": "word"
        },
        {
          "term": "delaying the inevitable",
          "ko": "피할 수 없는 일을 미루는 것",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 48.92,
      "end": 62.16,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "But I didn't want to get halfway into a trip to Yellowstone before Phil discovered what malevolent hellspawn we have for children, whom I love very much.",
          "start": 48.92,
          "end": 56.76
        },
        {
          "text": "Alex, honey, that's a cute sweater. Doesn't Haley have one like that?",
          "start": 59.48,
          "end": 62.16
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "malevolent",
          "ko": "악의에 찬, 사악한",
          "type": "word"
        },
        {
          "term": "hellspawn",
          "ko": "지옥에서 온 것, 악마 같은 존재",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 62.2,
      "end": 65.08,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Oh, it actually is hers.",
          "start": 62.2,
          "end": 63.15
        },
        {
          "text": "- I took it from her closet before we left. - Really?",
          "start": 63.15,
          "end": 65.08
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 65.24,
      "end": 68.09,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Oh, sorry, girls.",
          "start": 65.24,
          "end": 66.82
        },
        {
          "text": "Didn't mean to start a whole thing.",
          "start": 66.82,
          "end": 68.09
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 68.09,
      "end": 73.52,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I'm so sick of you always looking better in my clothes.",
          "start": 68.09,
          "end": 72.16
        },
        {
          "text": "When did that happen?",
          "start": 72.16,
          "end": 73.52
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "sick of",
          "ko": "~에 진저리가 난, 지긋지긋한",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 73.68,
      "end": 78,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Are you okay with this?",
          "start": 73.68,
          "end": 74.72
        },
        {
          "text": "Oh, yeah. She can wear whatever she wants after I've had it for six months.",
          "start": 74.88,
          "end": 78
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 78.04,
      "end": 81.04,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Huh.",
          "start": 78.04,
          "end": 78.54
        },
        {
          "text": "Or I get it automatically if you buy anything that looks like it.",
          "start": 78.54,
          "end": 81.04
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 81.28,
      "end": 87.96,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "This just feels right, huh, team?",
          "start": 81.28,
          "end": 83.44
        },
        {
          "text": "Matter of fact, I was thinking we could all drive up to Yellowstone this summer.",
          "start": 83.88,
          "end": 87.96
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 88.12,
      "end": 94.08,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "But I say, let's take this biatch ocean to ocean.",
          "start": 88.12,
          "end": 92.6
        },
        {
          "text": "- That'd be cool. - Awesome.",
          "start": 92.64,
          "end": 94.08
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "ocean to ocean",
          "ko": "대서양에서 태평양까지, 대륙 횡단",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 94.12,
      "end": 96.8,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "We're doing it.",
          "start": 94.12,
          "end": 95.2
        },
        {
          "text": "Phil! The road!",
          "start": 96.08,
          "end": 96.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 96.84,
      "end": 104.72,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Hey!",
          "start": 96.84,
          "end": 97.48
        },
        {
          "text": "I don't know what button I just pressed, but that was amazing.",
          "start": 101.2,
          "end": 104.72
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 112.56,
      "end": 121.08,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Perfect freaking harmony. That's when it hit me.",
          "start": 112.56,
          "end": 116
        },
        {
          "text": "Maybe it's not the cold confines of a moving vehicle that brings out the worst in my kids.",
          "start": 116.68,
          "end": 121.08
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "it hit me",
          "ko": "문득 깨달았다",
          "type": "idiom"
        },
        {
          "term": "confines",
          "ko": "비좁은 한정된 공간",
          "type": "word"
        },
        {
          "term": "brings out the worst in",
          "ko": "~의 최악의 면을 끌어내다",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 121.08,
      "end": 129.64,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Maybe I bring out the worst in them when there's no fun lovin Phil around to neutralize my toxins.",
          "start": 121.08,
          "end": 127.6
        },
        {
          "text": "I was in a full shame spiral.",
          "start": 128.16,
          "end": 129.64
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "neutralize",
          "ko": "중화시키다, 무력화하다",
          "type": "word"
        },
        {
          "term": "shame spiral",
          "ko": "수치심에 빠져드는 악순환",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 129.96,
      "end": 133.84,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Oh! A bee!",
          "start": 129.96,
          "end": 130.88
        },
        {
          "text": "And then something wonderful happened.",
          "start": 132,
          "end": 133.84
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 134.16,
      "end": 137.47,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I got it.",
          "start": 134.16,
          "end": 134.88
        },
        {
          "text": "- Oh! You idiot! - Kill it!",
          "start": 135.12,
          "end": 137.47
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 137.47,
      "end": 139.76,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "No, don't.",
          "start": 137.47,
          "end": 138.24
        },
        {
          "text": "Haven't you heard of colony collapse?",
          "start": 138.24,
          "end": 139.76
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "colony collapse",
          "ko": "(벌의) 군집 붕괴 현상",
          "type": "phrase"
        },
        {
          "term": "endangered",
          "ko": "멸종 위기에 처한",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 139.8,
      "end": 142.31,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Bees are endangered.",
          "start": 139.8,
          "end": 141
        },
        {
          "text": "Okay, guys. Stand still.",
          "start": 141.08,
          "end": 142.31
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 142.31,
      "end": 145.12,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "It can't see you if you're not moving.",
          "start": 142.31,
          "end": 143.92
        },
        {
          "text": "It's coming near me.",
          "start": 144.12,
          "end": 145.12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 146.16,
      "end": 149.48,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "- Do I look like a bee? - No, it was an accident!",
          "start": 146.16,
          "end": 148.4
        },
        {
          "text": "So is this!",
          "start": 148.6,
          "end": 149.48
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 152.61,
      "end": 157.77,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Everyone remain calm.",
          "start": 152.61,
          "end": 154.04
        },
        {
          "text": "I'll just open up the double tilt Swiss skylight and the airflow will pull the bee out.",
          "start": 154.04,
          "end": 157.77
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 157.81,
      "end": 160.97,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "- There's another bee, Dad! - We must be near it's cave!",
          "start": 157.81,
          "end": 160.03
        },
        {
          "text": "Oh, my God!",
          "start": 160.03,
          "end": 160.97
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 160.97,
      "end": 164.01,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "There's so much stupid in here.",
          "start": 160.97,
          "end": 162.21
        },
        {
          "text": "All right, I'm pulling this thing over.",
          "start": 162.25,
          "end": 164.01
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "pulling this thing over",
          "ko": "(차를) 길가에 세우다",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 164.29,
      "end": 166.89,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Those are the wipers. Claire!",
          "start": 164.29,
          "end": 166.05
        },
        {
          "text": "Say something.",
          "start": 166.09,
          "end": 166.89
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 167.41,
      "end": 170.19,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Kids, stop, please.",
          "start": 167.41,
          "end": 169.29
        },
        {
          "text": "Hey.",
          "start": 169.69,
          "end": 170.19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 170.29,
      "end": 175.03,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "There are daily flights to Yellowstone.",
          "start": 170.29,
          "end": 172.41
        },
        {
          "text": "You ripped my sweater?",
          "start": 174.01,
          "end": 175.03
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 175.03,
      "end": 177.09,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "My sweater!",
          "start": 175.03,
          "end": 175.67
        },
        {
          "text": "Which you shouldn't even be wearing.",
          "start": 175.67,
          "end": 177.09
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 177.77,
      "end": 181.85,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "- Get off! My sweater! - Short layover in Salt Lake.",
          "start": 177.77,
          "end": 180.05
        },
        {
          "text": "Are you really not gonna do anything?",
          "start": 180.21,
          "end": 181.85
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "layover",
          "ko": "(여행 중) 경유, 중간 기착",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 181.89,
      "end": 184.05,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Oh, Phil.",
          "start": 181.89,
          "end": 182.45
        },
        {
          "text": "You must have known this was gonna happen.",
          "start": 182.45,
          "end": 184.05
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 184.09,
      "end": 190.53,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I know that tone. You're making a point.",
          "start": 184.09,
          "end": 186.37
        },
        {
          "text": "Better that you find out who they are now than when you're halfway across the country.",
          "start": 186.81,
          "end": 190.53
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "making a point",
          "ko": "(일부러) 자기 생각을 입증해 보이다",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 191.81,
      "end": 203.09,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I guess I'm just a naive boob who thought we liked each other.",
          "start": 191.81,
          "end": 194.61
        },
        {
          "text": "Obviously, it was too much to ask to think that we could take one magnificent trip in a tricked out, state of the art RV to see the sun dancing off the Pacific.",
          "start": 195.29,
          "end": 203.09
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "boob",
          "ko": "(속어) 얼간이, 멍청이",
          "type": "word"
        },
        {
          "term": "too much to ask",
          "ko": "지나친 요구",
          "type": "idiom"
        },
        {
          "term": "tricked out",
          "ko": "한껏 꾸민, 화려하게 개조한",
          "type": "idiom"
        },
        {
          "term": "state of the art",
          "ko": "최첨단의",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 203.49,
      "end": 211,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "What a huge ask! [Smacks bee] Ow!",
          "start": 203.49,
          "end": 211
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
